<main id="contenido" class="wrap business-page"><nav class="business-nav" aria-label="Business navigation"><a href="/en/negocios-locales/">Overview</a><a href="/en/negocios-locales/por-que-participar/">Why take part</a><a href="/en/negocios-locales/interes/" aria-current="page">Request information</a><a href="/en/negocios-locales/proceso/">How it works</a><a href="/en/negocios-locales/suscripciones/">Subscriptions</a><a href="/en/negocios-locales/impulsa-tu-destino/">Support your place</a></nav><section class="business-detail-intro business-hero-with-art"><div class="business-hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Request information</p><h1>Let’s talk about<br><em>your business.</em></h1><p class="intro">This form is for people who represent a local business. Leaving your details does not purchase a service or automatically publish a listing.</p></div><figure class="business-hero-art"><img src="../../../assets/proceso-negocio-editorial-v1.webp?v=8abbd699cf10" alt="A business representative preparing their business information" width="1536" height="1024" loading="eager"></figure></section><section id="contacto" class="section registration-section"><div class="registration-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Local business request</p><h2>Let’s start with<br><em>the essentials.</em></h2><p>The form takes only a few minutes. It lets us learn about your business and contact you; it does not create a contract or publish information automatically.</p><p class="registration-help">Is your business already listed? <a href="/reclamar-negocio/?lang=en">Request access to manage my business →</a><br>Still considering it? <a href="/en/negocios-locales/proceso/">See how it works →</a></p></div><div class="notice registration-requirements"><strong>What you need to submit</strong><span>Fields marked with *, plus an email address or phone number. At the end, you will confirm that you represent the business and authorise us to contact you.</span></div><form id="business-registration" class="registration-form" action="../../../api/participation.php" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="lang" value="es"><input type="hidden" name="csrf"><input type="hidden" name="request_key"><div class="notice" id="registration-availability" role="status">You can fill in the fields. We are checking whether submissions are available.</div><fieldset id="registration-fields"><fieldset class="registration-group"><legend><span>1</span> Your business</legend><div class="form-grid"><label for="lead-name">Your name (owner or representative) *<input id="lead-name" name="name" required maxlength="120" autocomplete="name"><small data-error="name"></small></label><label for="lead-business">Business or brand name *<input id="lead-business" name="business" required maxlength="160" autocomplete="organization"><small data-error="business"></small></label><label for="lead-category">What type of service do you offer? *<select id="lead-category" name="category" required><option value="">Choose an option</option><optgroup label="Service type"><option value="hospedaje">Accommodation</option><option value="alimentacion">Food and dining</option><option value="licores">Liquor sales</option><option value="vida-nocturna">Bars, nightclubs and nightlife</option><option value="comercio">Supermarkets, shops and retail</option><option value="salud">Pharmacy and health</option><option value="experiencias">Experiences and activities</option><option value="cultura">Culture and entertainment</option><option value="transporte">Transport</option><option value="servicios">Local services</option><option value="otro">Other</option></optgroup></select><small data-error="category"></small></label><label for="lead-department">Department *<select id="lead-department" name="contact_department" required><option value="">Select a department</option><?php require dirname(__DIR__,2).'/views/contact-department-options.php'; ?></select></label><label for="lead-town">Municipality or district *<select id="lead-town" name="municipality" required><option value="">Select your municipality</option><?php require dirname(__DIR__,2).'/views/contact-municipality-options.php'; ?></select><small data-error="municipality"></small></label><label class="form-wide" for="lead-description">What does your business offer? <span>(Optional)</span><textarea id="lead-description" name="description" maxlength="2000" rows="3" placeholder="E.g. rural cabins, rafting trips or handmade products."></textarea><small data-error="description"></small></label></div></fieldset><fieldset class="registration-group"><legend><span>2</span> How to contact you</legend><p class="group-note">Provide at least one channel. We will use this contact only to discuss your request.</p><div class="form-grid"><label for="lead-email">Email address<input id="lead-email" type="email" name="email" maxlength="254" autocomplete="email"><small data-error="email"></small></label><div class="phone-field"><label for="lead-phone">Contact number<span class="phone-number"><span id="phone-prefix" class="phone-prefix" aria-label="Automatic dialling code">+57</span><input id="lead-phone" name="phone_number" type="tel" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="10" pattern="3[0-9]{9}" autocomplete="tel-national" aria-describedby="phone-help phone-prefix"></span></label><fieldset class="phone-options"><legend>Contact me by</legend><div class="phone-choices"><label><input type="radio" name="phone_type" value="fijo">Landline</label><label><input type="radio" name="phone_type" value="celular" checked>Mobile</label><label><input type="radio" name="phone_type" value="whatsapp">WhatsApp</label></div></fieldset><small id="phone-help">Enter the 10-digit mobile number, starting with 3. Do not include +57.</small><small data-error="phone"></small></div></div></fieldset><fieldset class="registration-group registration-confirmation"><legend><span>3</span> Confirm your request</legend><label class="check-label"><input name="understanding" type="checkbox" value="1" required><span class="consent-text"><span class="required-mark" aria-hidden="true">*</span> I confirm that I represent this business and that this registration only allows Explorando Lugares to contact me; it does not publish my business or purchase a subscription automatically.</span><small data-error="understanding"></small></label><label class="check-label"><input name="consent" type="checkbox" value="1" required><span class="consent-text"><span class="required-mark" aria-hidden="true">*</span> I authorise Explorando Lugares to use these details only to contact me. See the <a href="/en/privacidad/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">privacy policy (opens in a new tab) →</a>.</span><small data-error="consent"></small></label><div class="form-trap" aria-hidden="true"><label>Leave blank<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></div><button type="submit" class="pill" id="registration-submit" disabled>Send request</button><p class="submit-note">The button becomes available when registration is enabled. Before sending, we will check the required fields and your confirmations.</p></fieldset></fieldset><p class="status" id="registration-result" role="status" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1"></p></form><noscript><p>Enable JavaScript to check availability and submit the form. No data has been sent.</p></noscript><p class="required-note registration-private-note">Your details do not appear in the public directory.</p></section><script src="../../../assets/participation.js?v=c65cf4d7ee98" defer></script><script src="../../../assets/contact-options.js?v=8d989826231a" defer></script><script src="../../../assets/languages.js?v=711081a13b31" defer></script><script src="../../../assets/phone.js?v=1e61c5866059" defer></script><script src="../../../assets/registration.js?v=8ebd3ce4c7ec" defer></script></main>
